The Federal Reserve is making waves again! Originally thought that a rate cut in December was a sure thing, but now there's talk of "doubt about necessity," causing the big coin (#BTC ) to jump around. But don't panic, this wave of volatility is actually an opportunity for the crypto world!


Retail investors, stay steady with these three tips to win easily:

1️⃣ Don't let short-term news dictate your actions; remain calm in drops and don't get overly excited in rises;

2️⃣ Dollar-cost averaging + phased allocation in BTC/#ETH , lengthen the cycle to average out costs;

3️⃣ Pay attention to counter-trend sectors, such as Depin and blockchain gaming, as small yet beautiful tracks may quietly explode!


Last time the Federal Reserve turned hawkish, the big coin dropped 5% in a day, but rebounded over 10% a week later. Those who held their positions actually got a bargain! Policy fluctuations are a touchstone that can filter out true diamond hands.

